{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/eaa7213cb399d00905bfbd5bf9084427.avif?t=1773774777\" width=579 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEMBOY called it \u201cMASSAGE\u201d\ud83d\ude08\ud83d\udca6 is a spicy 2D visual novel with dating-sim elements and an interactive mini-game where your hands do all the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/98ed0ec32260c8a4cff88b740df2db3d.poster.avif?t=1773774777\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/98ed0ec32260c8a4cff88b740df2db3d.webm?t=1773774777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/98ed0ec32260c8a4cff88b740df2db3d.mp4?t=1773774777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/93c8557c19f272fa82261493b763e855.avif?t=1773774777\" width=587 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a young, slightly na\u00efve masseur who inherits a\u2026 let\u2019s say, very special massage parlor from your grandpa. Surprise: your clients are charming femboys with some very particular desires. Nail the sessions and you\u2019ll unlock not just their wallets, but their hearts (and more \ud83d\ude09).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/fefad7c41496e17ef721dd17a4f5b5cd.poster.avif?t=1773774777\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/fefad7c41496e17ef721dd17a4f5b5cd.webm?t=1773774777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/fefad7c41496e17ef721dd17a4f5b5cd.mp4?t=1773774777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills, uncover the salon\u2019s secrets, flirt, tease, and figure out why grandpa left you this unique business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/ed01383b8c9cc7c17e3487f20d9949cc.avif?t=1773774777\" width=585 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Interactive mini-game \u2014 control the intensity and touch zones to keep your client fully satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Flirt &amp; relationships \u2014 build romantic connections with your femboy clients by delving into their personal matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Money matters \u2014 earn cash to upgrade skills or get handy boosters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Adult content \u2014 unlock explicit scenes, fresh artwork, and juicy storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Engaging plot \u2014 discover your grandpa\u2019s secret and the backstory of each client.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920180/extras/c0bb5248b2ed2f1c9561a0fdb6bc4bd0.poster.avif?t=1773774777\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"htt